{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"whist UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"whist.copy.howAnswer","keys":["whist.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Quatre seients juguen en parelles fixes: tu i el teu company esteu asseguts l'un davant de l'altre, com ho fan els dos oponents. Cada jugador rep cartes ZXQPH0000QXZ. Seguiu el pal principal quan sigui possible; guanya l'atzar més alt, altrament guanya la carta més alta del pal principal. S'atorga un punt per cada baza superior a sis. El primer equip que aconsegueixi set punts guanya.","record_id":"4ca918a4039ba038282dc258e35afc98d9b6c638cb87156350ae4a00bd7849f5","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":1.2435274074999825,"source":"Four seats play in fixed partnerships: you and your partner sit opposite each other, as do the two opponents. Each player receives 13 cards. Follow the led suit when possible; the highest trump wins, otherwise the highest card of the suit led wins. A point is awarded for each trick above six. The first team to seven points wins.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"6a4c21551255a78fd3d90c752adeaf3186f414ef860a7f91e5a45230e269ec43","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Quatre seients juguen en parelles fixes: tu i el teu company esteu asseguts l'un davant de l'altre, com ho fan els dos oponents. Cada jugador rep cartes 13. Seguiu el pal principal quan sigui possible; guanya l'atzar més alt, altrament guanya la carta més alta del pal principal. S'atorga un punt per cada baza superior a sis. El primer equip que aconsegueixi set punts guanya.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
